<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT AUSTRALIA BY SEVEN WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT AUSTRALIA BY SEVEN WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat Australia by seven wickets in their limited overs World Series match at the Gabba on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 281-4 in 50 overs (Mark Waugh 102, Stuart Law 93); West Indies 284-3 in 48.5 overs (Carl Hooper 110 not out, Brian Lara 102).</p>
